# ── Sakhi AI environment variables ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to your environment / Keys UI. Never commit real values.

# Supabase (client — safe to expose in the browser)
# Get these from: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# NOTE: sign-in uses Supabase Auth's built-in EMAIL OTP (a 6-digit one-time
# code). No extra secrets are needed in the app, but the Supabase project
# must be configured once (Dashboard → Auth):
#   * Email provider enabled (Auth → Providers → Email).
#   * Magic Link email template edited to include {{ .Token }} so users
#     receive a numeric code instead of a clickable link (Auth → Email
#     Templates → Magic Link). No magic-link or confirmation-link flow is
#     used by the app.
#
# The mobile number is still collected during onboarding and stored on the
# user's profile (for a future SMS OTP migration and SOS alerts), but the
# login code itself is always delivered by email.
